              "meta_title": "What Are the Limitations of AI? | NINZ AI Basics FAQ",
              "meta_description": "Understand common AI limitations, including mistakes, outdated information, bias, missing context, and the need for human judgment.",
              "canonical_url": "https://ninz.me/faq/ai-basics/what-are-the-limitations-of-ai/",
