                  "short_answer": "You do not always need to pay for an AI assistant. Free access can be enough for learning, brainstorming, and simple tasks. Paid plans may be useful when you need higher usage, better availability, stronger models, file tools, memory, research features, team controls, privacy commitments, or business-oriented functionality.",
