                  "short_answer": "AI can help with marketing by brainstorming ideas, outlining content, drafting first versions, repurposing messages, identifying audience questions, and organizing campaigns. Human review is still needed for accuracy, originality, brand voice, customer promises, legal compliance, and evidence-based claims.",
