          "short_answer": "A grant application may request business identity and ownership details, registrations, a project plan, budget, timeline, financial records, resumes, licenses, tax information, matching-fund evidence, and certifications. Federal applications may require an active SAM.gov registration and Unique Entity ID. Follow the specific notice's checklist.",
